at":null,"assignee":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible at least from 4.6.3 to 4.7.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.3.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Ti Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.16.1074) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600H with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 15.34 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe engine crashes in the release builds (official stable) if you have your compute list setup so they produce `Tracker can't have more than one type of usage in the same compute list. Compute list usage is Storage Image Read Write and the requested usage is Texture Sample` error which can be observed only in the debug build of the engine.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDo the below steps with both Vulkan and DirectX drivers. It will crash only in DirectX.\n\n1. Take the official compositor demo effect from https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/blob/master/compute/post_shader/post_process_shader.gd.\n2. Add a new uniform of type `UNIFORM_TYPE_SAMPLER_WITH_TEXTURE` with the color layer bound to it.\n3. Add the effect to the compositor and observe the crash in the stable release and spam of `Tracker can't have more than one type of usage in the same compute list. Compute list usage is Storage Image Read Write and the requested usage is Texture Sample` in the debug build.\n\nSample code:\n```gdscript\n# Add this after the depth uniform\nvar color_tex_uniform := RDUniform.new()\ncolor_tex_uniform.uniform_type = RenderingDevice.UNIFORM_TYPE_SAMPLER_WITH_TEXTURE\ncolor_tex_uniform.binding = 3\ncolor_tex_uniform.add_id(nearest_sampler)\ncolor_tex_uniform.add_id(color_image)\nvar uniform_set_rid: RID = UniformSetCacheRD.get_cache(shader, 0, [scene_data_uniform, color_uniform, depth_uniform, color_tex_uniform])\n```\n\n```glsl\n// Add this after the depth texture uniform\nlayout(set = 0, binding = 3) uniform sampler2D color_texture;\n```\n\nWrite something in the `shader_code` text field for the shader to recompile.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121271/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121271/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}